{
 "_": "J4 stats: the stats line is Pro-only (can('detailedStats')), so this run sets the twin to Pro, asks 'Summarize it' in the sheet for the stats 'read … · 9 of 9 pages', then 'Who can veto a bill?' for '… passages', and sets the twin back to free. DOCID filled in by the shell.",
 "steps": [
